  "title": "Skyward Specialty Welcomes Christopher Peirce to Board of Directors - Skyward Specialty Insurance",
  "summary": "Skyward Specialty Insurance Group announced the appointment of Christopher Peirce to its Board of Directors, effective Feb. 1, 2026. A seasoned financial and operational leader, Peirce brings 30 years of global property and casualty experience from Liberty Mutual Insurance, where he served as chief financial officer and president of Global Specialty and Commercial Markets. His appointment further strengthens Skyward Specialty’s board as the Company prepares for continued growth and strategic initiatives.",
